---

<BaseLayout
  title="Aeris Research — Independent Technology Intelligence"
  description="Independent technology research and analysis across AI, cloud, cybersecurity, SaaS, and fintech. Aeris Research delivers vendor-neutral intelligence for enterprise technology buyers, investors, and strategy teams."
  pageType="homepage"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero hero--homepage" aria-label="Hero section">
    <div class="hero__bg-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero__bg-pattern"></div>
    <div class="container hero__container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <p class="hero__eyebrow">Est. 2013 · San Francisco · London · Singapore</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title">Technology Intelligence<br /><em>Without Compromise</em></h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">
          Aeris Research delivers vendor-neutral technology intelligence across AI, cloud, cybersecurity, SaaS, and fintech. Our 180+ analyst team conducts hands-on product evaluations and primary research across 62 technology sectors — serving enterprise CIOs, institutional investors, and strategy teams who need the unfiltered truth on the technology landscape.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a href="/research" class="btn btn--teal">Explore Research Library</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--outline">Request a Brief</a>
          <a href="/sample-report" class="btn btn--outline-light">Download Sample Report</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__trust">
          <span>Trusted by 200+ enterprise clients and 50+ institutional investors in 25+ countries</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Live tech data card -->
      <div class="hero__live-card">
        <div class="live-card">
          <div class="live-card__header">
            <span class="live-card__label">Vendor Tracker</span>
            <span class="live-card__update">Live ratings</span>
          </div>
          <div class="live-card__data">
            {techData.map(item => (
              <div class="live-card__item">
                <span class="live-card__commodity">{item.vendor}</span>
                <span class="live-card__price">{item.rating}</span>
                <span class={`live-card__change ${item.positive ? 'live-card__change--up' : 'live-card__change--down'}`}>
                  {item.change}
                </span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="live-card__footer">
            <a href="/live-data" class="live-card__link">View full dashboard →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__scroll-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DATA TICKER -->
  <section class="data-ticker" aria-label="Technology intelligence ticker">
    <div class="ticker-content">
      {tickerHeadlines.map(h => (<span class="ticker-item">{h}</span>))}
      {tickerHeadlines.map(h => (<span class="ticker-item">{h}</span>))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS BAR -->
  <section class="stats-bar" aria-label="Key statistics">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-bar__grid">
        {stats.map(stat => (
          <div class="stats-bar__item">
            <span class="stats-bar__value">{stat.value}</span>
            <span class="stats-bar__label">{stat.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="section section--intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="intro__wrapper">
        <div class="intro__main">
          <p class="section__eyebrow">What Sets Us Apart</p>
          <h2 class="section__title" id="intro-title">Research Built for the Technology Decisions That Matter</h2>

          <div class="intro__text-block">
            <p class="intro__para--lead">
              Aeris Research was founded on a single conviction: technology buyers, investors, and strategists deserve research that is genuinely independent — free from vendor sponsorships, paid placements, and the conflicts of interest that compromise most technology analyst firms.
            </p>
            <p class="intro__para">
              Over twelve years, we have built one of the most trusted independent technology research franchises in the market. Our analyst teams combine deep technical expertise with enterprise practitioner networks, delivering assessments that go beyond marketing claims to test what technology actually does — at enterprise scale, in production environments, under real-world conditions.
            </p>
            <p class="intro__para">
              Our clients — CIOs shortlisting enterprise software, VCs evaluating B2B SaaS investments, PE firms conducting technical due diligence, and strategy teams benchmarking digital transformation progress — rely on Aeris for intelligence that is accurate, actionable, and completely conflict-free.
            </p>
            <blockquote class="intro__pullquote">
              <span class="intro__quote-mark">"</span>
              <p>Aeris Research is the only firm I have encountered that combines the technical depth of an engineering team with the analytical rigour of a tier-one research house. Their AI landscape report saved us from a catastrophic vendor decision.</p>
              <span class="intro__quote-attrib">— CTO, Fortune 200 Technology Company</span>
            </blockquote>
            <a href="/about" class="intro__link">Learn more about Aeris Research →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="intro__sidebar">
          <div class="intro__promise-box">
            <h3 class="intro__promise-title">Our Promise</h3>
            <ul class="intro__promise-list">
              <li><span class="promise-check">✓</span> Zero vendor sponsorship</li>
              <li><span class="promise-check">✓</span> Hands-on product testing</li>
              <li><span class="promise-check">✓</span> Transparent scoring methodology</li>
              <li><span class="promise-check">✓</span> Enterprise practitioner validation</li>
              <li><span class="promise-check">✓</span> Longitudinal vendor tracking</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTOR EXPERTISE GRID -->
  <section class="section section--sectors section--bg-soft" aria-labelledby="sectors-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header section__header--center">
        <p class="section__eyebrow">Deep Coverage</p>
        <h2 class="section__title section__title--center" id="sectors-title">8 Technology Sectors</h2>
        <p class="section__subtitle">Each sector represents 5+ years of dedicated analyst coverage, proprietary vendor databases, and structured practitioner research.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sectors-grid">
        {sectors.map(sector => (
          <div class="sector-card">
            <div class="sector-card__icon">{sector.icon}</div>
            <h3 class="sector-card__title">{sector.title}</h3>
            <p class="sector-card__desc">{sector.desc}</p>
            <div class="sector-card__meta">
              <span class="sector-card__reports">{sector.reports} reports published</span>
            </div>
            <a href={`/sectors/${sector.id}`} class="sector-card__link">Explore sector →</a>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURED REPORTS -->
  <section class="section section--featured-reports" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header section__header--center">
        <p class="section__eyebrow">From the Research Library</p>
        <h2 class="section__title section__title--center" id="featured-title">Flagship Reports</h2>
        <p class="section__subtitle">Select recent publications from our enterprise technology research program.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="featured-reports-grid">
        {featuredReports.map(report => (
          <div class="report-card">
            <div class="report-card__cover">
              <div class="report-card__category-tag">{report.category}</div>
              <div class="report-card__title">{report.title}</div>
              <div class="report-card__pages">{report.pages} pages</div>
            </div>
            <div class="report-card__footer">
              <a href={`/research/${report.slug}`} class="btn btn--small btn--teal">Download Sample</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="section__cta-center">
        <a href="/research" class="btn btn--dark">Browse Full Research Library →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LATEST RESEARCH -->
  {posts.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section section--latest-intelligence section--bg-soft" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__header section__header--center">
          <p class="section__eyebrow">Fresh Intelligence</p>
          <h2 class="section__title section__title--center" id="latest-title">Latest Research</h2>
          <p class="section__subtitle">Our most recent publications — independent technology analysis across AI, cloud, security, and enterprise software.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="article-grid">
          {posts.map(post => (
            <ArticleCard
              title={post.data.title}
              slug={post.slug}
              category={post.data.category}
              description={post.data.description}
              author={post.data.author}
              date={post.data.date}
              featured_image={post.data.featured_image}
            />
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="section__cta-center" style="margin-top: 40px;">
          <a href="/research" class="btn btn--dark">View All Research →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <!-- SERVICES GRID -->
  <section class="section section--services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header section__header--center">
        <p class="section__eyebrow">Our Capabilities</p>
        <h2 class="section__title section__title--center" id="services-title">Six Integrated Service Lines</h2>
        <p class="section__subtitle">Comprehensive technology intelligence covering the full research lifecycle — from hands-on product testing to board-level strategic delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        {services.map(svc => (
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="service-card__icon" set:html={svc.icon} />
            <h3 class="service-card__title">{svc.title}</h3>
            <p class="service-card__desc">{svc.desc}</p>
            <a href="/services" class="service-card__link">Learn more →</a>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CLIENT TYPES -->
  <section class="section section--client-types section--bg-soft" aria-labelledby="clients-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header section__header--center">
        <p class="section__eyebrow">Who We Serve</p>
        <h2 class="section__title section__title--center" id="clients-title">Built for Technology Decision-Makers</h2>
        <p class="section__subtitle">Aeris serves six primary client categories, each with distinct technology intelligence requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="client-types-grid">
        {clientTypes.map(client => (
          <div class="client-card">
            <h3 class="client-card__type">{client.type}</h3>
            <p class="client-card__desc">{client.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY AERIS (Dark) -->
  <section class="section section--dark section--why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why__grid">
        <div class="why__text">
          <p class="section__eyebrow section__eyebrow--teal">Our Principles</p>
          <h2 class="section__title section__title--light" id="why-title">The Aeris Standard</h2>
          <div class="why__points">
            {whyPoints.map(point => (
              <div class="why__point">
                <div class="why__point-icon">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3>{point.title}</h3>
                  <p>{point.desc}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="why__visual">
          <img src="/images/why-aeris.png" alt="Aeris analyst reviewing technology research" loading="lazy" class="why__image" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- METHODOLOGY PREVIEW -->
  <section class="section section--bg-soft" aria-labelledby="method-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header section__header--center">
        <p class="section__eyebrow">How We Work</p>
        <h2 class="section__title section__title--center" id="method-title">A Rigorous Four-Stage Process</h2>
        <p class="section__subtitle">Every Aeris research deliverable passes through four structured stages — ensuring our ratings reflect reality, not vendor marketing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="methodology-steps">
        {methodologySteps.map((step, i) => (
          <div class="method-step">
            <div class="method-step__num">{step.num}</div>
            <div class="method-step__content">
              <h3 class="method-step__title">{step.title}</h3>
              <p class="method-step__desc">{step.desc}</p>
